# Waterfind — environment variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in values. NEVER commit .env (it is gitignored).
#
# No stack is chosen yet, so there are no required variables. Add real ones here (with safe
# placeholder/example values, never real secrets) as the implementation takes shape — e.g. model
# provider credentials, Waterfind API endpoints/credentials, datastore URLs.

# Example (uncomment and rename as needed):
# SOME_API_KEY=
# SOME_SERVICE_URL=
